msgid "Contents"
msgstr "目录"

msgid "megalibpy documentation"
msgstr "megalibpy 文档"

msgid ""
"``megalibpy`` reads, inspects, and edits MEGAlib/Cosima ``.source`` files from Python. Use it to "
"inspect simulation parameters, change a source's Galactic coordinates or flux, and save the "
"updated configuration for Cosima. The current parser supports one run with one source per file."
msgstr ""
"``megalibpy`` 用于在 Python 中读取、检查和编辑 MEGAlib/Cosima 的 ``.source`` 文件。你可以检查模拟参数、修改源的银河坐标或流量，并保存供 "
"Cosima 使用的新配置。当前解析器支持每个文件包含一个 run 和一个 source。"

msgid ""
"The online documentation follows the latest successfully checked ``develop`` branch. Changes on "
"unmerged feature branches are not published to the main site. The Cosima guide describes "
"execution features separately from the source-file configuration classes."
msgstr "在线文档跟随通过验证的最新 ``develop`` 分支。未合并功能分支的修改不会发布到主站。Cosima 指南单独介绍执行功能，并区分它与源文件配置类的职责。"

msgid "The source code is available on `GitHub <https://github.com/Yong2Sheng/megalibpy>`_."
msgstr "源代码托管于 `GitHub <https://github.com/Yong2Sheng/megalibpy>`_。"
